WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.903
Window functions solve a different analytical
problem from GROUP BY GROUP

00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:11.267
BY collapses many input rows into one row per group
A window

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:16.069
function usually keeps the original detail rows and
adds analytical context beside

00:00:16.096 --> 00:00:21.341
them For example we can keep every employee row
while adding a

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:26.977
department rank or department average PARTITION BY
defines groups for the

00:00:27.003 --> 00:00:31.319
window calculation while ORDER BY inside OVER can
define ranking or running

00:00:31.332 --> 00:00:36.569
sequence This is powerful because you do not have to
choose between

00:00:36.596 --> 00:00:42.881
detail and summary You can display both in the same
result When

00:00:42.894 --> 00:00:46.341
deciding between GROUP BY and a window function ask
whether you want

00:00:46.354 --> 00:00:48.394
to collapse rows or keep them visible
